/* 顶栏图标：酒馆自己的九个按钮不画字体图标，换成上面的（别的扩展加的按钮保留它自己的图标，见下面） */
#top-settings-holder > :where(#ai-config-button, #sys-settings-button, #advanced-formatting-button, #WI-SP-button, #user-settings-button, #backgrounds-button, #extensions-settings-button, #persona-management-button, #rightNavHolder) .drawer-icon {
    font-size: 0 !important;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0;
}

#top-settings-holder > :where(#ai-config-button, #sys-settings-button, #advanced-formatting-button, #WI-SP-button, #user-settings-button, #backgrounds-button, #extensions-settings-button, #persona-management-button, #rightNavHolder) .drawer-icon::before {
    content: '' !important;
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask: var(--xy-ico) center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: var(--xy-ico) center / contain no-repeat;
}

#ai-config-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-presets); }
#ai-config-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-presets-on); }
#sys-settings-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-api); }
#sys-settings-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-api-on); }
#advanced-formatting-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-format); }
#advanced-formatting-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-format-on); }
#WI-SP-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-book); }
#WI-SP-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-book-on); }
#user-settings-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-gear); }
#user-settings-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-gear-on); }
#backgrounds-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-image); }
#backgrounds-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-image-on); }
#extensions-settings-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-ext); }
#extensions-settings-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-ext-on); }
#persona-management-button .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-persona); }
#persona-management-button .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-persona-on); }
#rightNavHolder .drawer-icon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-library); }
#rightNavHolder .drawer-icon.openIcon { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-library-on); }

/* 别的扩展加的顶栏按钮：保留它自己的字体图标，只统一大小、颜色；排在最后，前面隔一道细线 */
#top-settings-holder > :where(:not(#ai-config-button, #sys-settings-button, #advanced-formatting-button, #WI-SP-button, #user-settings-button, #backgrounds-button, #extensions-settings-button, #persona-management-button, #rightNavHolder)) {
    order: 10;
}

#top-settings-holder > :where(:not(#ai-config-button, #sys-settings-button, #advanced-formatting-button, #WI-SP-button, #user-settings-button, #backgrounds-button, #extensions-settings-button, #persona-management-button, #rightNavHolder)) .drawer-icon {
    font-size: 19px !important;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    opacity: 1;
}

#top-settings-holder:has(> :where(:not(#ai-config-button, #sys-settings-button, #advanced-formatting-button, #WI-SP-button, #user-settings-button, #backgrounds-button, #extensions-settings-button, #persona-management-button, #rightNavHolder)))::after {
    content: '';
    order: 9;
    align-self: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 1px;
    height: 18px;
    background: var(--xy-line);
}

/* 输入区左边两个按钮 */
#options_button,
#extensionsMenuButton {
    font-size: 0 !important;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
}

#options_button::before,
#extensionsMenuButton::before {
    content: '' !important;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    background: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask: var(--xy-ico) center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: var(--xy-ico) center / contain no-repeat;
}

#options_button { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-more); }
#extensionsMenuButton { --xy-ico: var(--xy-i-spark); }
/* ==== end themes/xuyu/icons.css ==== */
